  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "总觉得我对这个地方有印象。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B89C95F9762115BF98FD94E2A573065B9670953708C61300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "连在这里也会和哥哥在一起……\n我除了不满还是不满。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDE57288FD991CC4E5F4F1A548C54E554E557284E008D7720262026000A621196644E864E0D6EE18FD8662F4E0D6EE1300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是正义社的人吧？\n真想看看大家的超级进化啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F6B634E49793E76844EBA5427FF1F000A771F60F3770B770B59275BB676848D857EA78FDB5316554AFF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我们跟他们来一场2vs2的对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C0010000201000000FF0C000A62114EEC8DDF4ED64EEC67654E00573A003200760073003276845BF962185427300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n这个时候你就配合我，积极些吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8FD94E2A65F650194F605C31914D54086211FF0C79EF67814E9B5427300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作为继承者，\n我要了解所有的超级进化！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C4E3A7EE7627F8005FF0C000A621189814E8689E36240670976848D857EA78FDB5316FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也希望能来场对决！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F5E0C671B80FD6765573A5BF951B3FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……事已至此，\n看来我无权拒绝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620264E8B5DF281F36B64FF0C000A770B6765621165E0674362D27EDD300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有些经验是必须战胜\n强劲的对手之后才能获得的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E9B7ECF9A8C662F5FC5987B621880DC000A5F3A52B276845BF9624B4E4B540E624D80FD83B75F977684300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "力，即是力量！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "529BFF0C5373662F529B91CFFF01FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到你还挺优柔寡断的？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D52304F608FD8633A4F1867D45BE165AD7684FF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "力，即是正义！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "529BFF0C5373662F6B634E49FF01FF0100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷这地方，连异次元密阿雷\n都有各种超级进化，简直太棒了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F78FD9573065B9FF0C8FDE5F026B2151435BC6963F96F7000A90FD6709540479CD8D857EA78FDB5316FF0C7B8076F4592A68D24E86300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "列阵兵！通过超级进化\n伸张正义，获取胜利吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521796355175FF01901A8FC78D857EA78FDB5316000A4F385F206B634E49FF0C83B753D680DC52295427FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水晶灯火灵……\n超级进化，打倒他们！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C346676706F706B707520262026000A8D857EA78FDB5316FF0C625350124ED64EECFF0100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "生命力爆发！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751F547D529B720653D1FF01FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超级列阵兵和\n超级水晶灯火灵，你们都太厉害了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857EA7521796355175548C000A8D857EA76C346676706F706B7075FF0C4F604EEC90FD592A53895BB34E86FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我本以为用超级进化的力量\n就能粉碎对手的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211672C4EE54E3A75288D857EA78FDB53167684529B91CF000A5C3180FD7C89788E5BF9624B7684300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皙白，超级进化后的宝可梦\n确实会变得更加强力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7699767DFF0C8D857EA78FDB5316540E76845B9D53EF68A6000A786E5B9E4F1A53D85F9766F452A05F3A529B300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，为了能更加充分发挥\n每只宝可梦的个性，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n训练家自身也要了解超级进化才行。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C4E3A4E8680FD66F452A05145520653D16325000A6BCF53EA5B9D53EF68A676844E2A6027FF0C00100001BE00000A8BAD7EC35BB681EA8EAB4E5F89814E8689E38D857EA78FDB5316624D884C300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是！\n我会奋发图强的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662FFF01000A62114F1A594B53D156FE5F3A7684300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看皙白这么听话，\n想必可尔妮是个很厉害的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B7699767D8FD94E48542C8BDDFF0C000A60F35FC553EF5C1459AE662F4E2A5F8853895BB376844EBA300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我非常感动。\n请收下这套服装。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211975E5E38611F52A83002000A8BF765364E0B8FD95957670D88C5300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢！\n不过，我的人设是不是太复杂了点？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C22FF01000A4E0D8FC7FF0C621176844EBA8BBE662F4E0D662F592A590D67424E8670B9FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "又是娑罗市道馆的馆主，\n又是超级进化继承者，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n现在还是超Z队的一员。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53C8662F5A117F575E0290539986768499864E3BFF0C000A53C8662F8D857EA78FDB53167EE7627F8005FF0C00100001BE00000A73B057288FD8662F8D85005A961F76844E005458300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我都不当轮滑手了，\n却穿上正义社的衣服的话，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n会不会让人很混乱呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190FD4E0D5F538F6E6ED1624B4E86FF0C000A53747A7F4E0A6B634E49793E76848863670D76848BDDFF0C00100001BE00000A4F1A4E0D4F1A8BA94EBA5F886DF74E715462FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好吧。\n那我就送给<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D54273002000A90A362115C3190017ED90010000201000000300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了\n皙白装扮修行套装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E86000A7699767D88C5626E4FEE884C595788C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皙白，你真失礼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7699767DFF0C4F60771F5931793C300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要让身为训练家的自己超级进化。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189818BA98EAB4E3A8BAD7EC35BB6768481EA5DF18D857EA78FDB5316300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里是……\n世上不存在的地方？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC662F20262026000A4E164E0A4E0D5B5857287684573065B9FF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "过于强大的力量恐怕会伴随疼痛……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而要克服这个弱点，\n需要的就是宝可梦和训练家的牵绊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FC74E8E5F3A59277684529B91CF605060154F1A4F34968F75BC75DB2026202600100001BE01000A800C8981514B670D8FD94E2A5F3170B9FF0C000A9700898176845C31662F5B9D53EF68A6548C8BAD7EC35BB6768472757ECAFF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
